      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "A **pivot table** summarizes a table by grouping rows into categories and calculating totals. Dragging a column to Rows gives one row per category, while dragging to Values totals the numbers. You will build this summary with formulas to master the concept."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "select",
      "prompt": "A sales table tracks orders by region and product. Select the units sold in `C2:C8`.",
      "grid": [
